name: The Tooth — money per card
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Tooth makes you lose $1 for each card played. Ante 1 boss: play small hands or use
  money engines (Golden Joker, To the Moon) to offset.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheTooth
    antes: [1]
should:
  - joker: GoldenJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: ToTheMoon
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
